{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34388","headline":"和袭美送孙发百篇游天台 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美送孙发百篇游天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直应天授与诗情，百咏唯消一日成。\n去把彩毫挥下国，归参黄绶别春卿。\n闲窥碧落怀烟雾，暂向金庭隐姓名。\n珍重兴公徒有赋，石梁深处是君行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}